  description: 'Reveal 1 "Azamina" Fusion Monster in your Extra Deck, and for every
    4 Levels it has (round down), send 1 "Sinful Spoils" card from your hand and/or
    field to the GY (if face-down, reveal it), then Special Summon that revealed
    monster. (This is treated as a Fusion Summon.) If this card is in the GY: You
    can target 1 "Azamina" monster you control or in your GY; shuffle it into the
    Deck, and if you do, add this card to your hand. You can only use this effect
    of "The Hallowed Azamina" once per turn.'
